 4. 👀 What we&#x27;re watching 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 Illustration: Annelise Capossela/Axios

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Next week will feature two big inflation indicators that will factor heavily into the Fed's interest rate decision on Sept. 16:

 Thursday: the August Producer Price Index, which measures wholesale prices. Friday: the Consumer Price Index, a measure of the prices consumers pay for goods and services. The big picture: All eyes are now on inflation. Today's strong jobs report strengthens the case for the Fed officials who see an urgent need to raise rates to keep prices in check, our Axios Macro colleagues write .

 
 
